sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User
    participant SUP as Supervisor
    participant FC as Fact-check agent
    participant RS as Research MCP server
    participant BLOG as Blog agent
    participant API as Blog API

    User->>SUP: "Publish post 12"
    SUP->>FC: ask_factcheck {task: "Check post 12"}
    FC->>RS: read_post 12
    RS->>API: GET /posts/12
    API-->>RS: title + text (RS keeps their hash)
    FC->>RS: web_search, fetch_page (sources)
    FC->>RS: submit_report {claims, verdicts, quotes, post_id: 12}
    Note over RS: Every "supported" verdict must quote a page fetched in this session
    RS->>API: POST /posts/12/fact-check {hash, time, report, signature}
    Note over API: Checks the signature (key only the site's services know) and that the hash matches the text now
    API-->>RS: recorded
    RS-->>FC: report + "Recorded on post 12"
    FC-->>SUP: per-claim table, recorded

    SUP->>BLOG: ask_blog {task: "Publish post 12"}
    BLOG->>API: POST /posts/12/publish (through the Blog MCP server)
    Note over API: Publishes only if the recorded hash still matches the title and text
    API-->>BLOG: published
    BLOG-->>SUP: report
    SUP-->>User: answer with the fact-check table
